category: Net
build-depends: cygport CUnit libcares-devel libcjson-devel libedit-devel libgmock-devel libgtest-devel libssl-devel libwrap-devel
sdesc: "Open source MQTT broker (utilities)"
ldesc: "Eclipse Mosquitto is an open source (EPL/EDL licensed) message broker that
implements the MQTT protocol versions 5.0, 3.1.1 and 3.1. Mosquitto is
lightweight and is suitable for use on all devices from low power single
board computers to full servers."
